{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Train!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Megalotrain</strong> is a top-down adventure game where you explore the cars of a magical train, collecting items, battling enemies, and unraveling secrets to find a way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/gameplay_1_gif.gif?t=1749164026\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the <strong>roll</strong> to dodge enemies and projectiles, and organize your weapons wisely to assemble your favorite set and progress through this adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/cambalhota.gif?t=1749164026\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Weapons and Items!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To face this train and its dangers, you'll need a good way to defend yourself! Choose from various types of weapons, including <strong>melee weapons</strong> for those who want to face danger head-on and engage in close combat, or <strong>ranged weapons</strong> for those who prefer a strategic approach!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rely on <strong>special items</strong>, such as those that can <strong>stop time</strong>, <strong>summon cannons</strong> to aid you in battle, or even <strong>teleport you</strong> away from danger! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/ezgif-57c01f6b1b6225__1_.gif?t=1749164026\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Bosses!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face a variety of bosses in this game! A socialite who hosts a children's show and is secretly a vampire, or an evil emperor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/bigodin_boss.gif?t=1749164026\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Allies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet allies like a friendly little witch named Clowth, or even a humanoid garlic named Norbs! They will help you in this battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/clowth_e_poig.gif?t=1749164026\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Relaxation is Necessary!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fishing is also fun! Fish and try your luck to collect various items and the rarest fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/pesca.gif?t=1749164026\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story and Characters!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a fun story and encounter a variety of characters in this adventure, complete with several <strong>cutscenes</strong> in the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/skipp.gif?t=1749164026\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>An Unusual Adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on unexpected moments in the game, from skiing down a mountain to battling a giant duck in a spaceship showdown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/espa\u00e7onave.gif?t=1749164026\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2701190?t=1749164026","background_raw":"https://st